WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
It remembers every person, tells you who to contact today,

2
00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:07.050
writes the message for that person.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.490
How does it work? At 8 it gives you the morning call: it tells you

4
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:15.990
who to contact today and reminds you to add the three people of the day. Not three hundred.

5
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:21.150
Because if you add three hundred people in a day, you then can't manage the relationships.

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.650
Three a day is ninety a month, guys. I challenge you to have ninety conversations in a month

7
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:31.930
and to really connect with ninety people: it's hard.

8
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.230
You wouldn't remember anything.

9
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.900
So three a day is already a lot of work.

10
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:44.370
The first day it's a quarter of an hour, the second a quarter of an hour, but after a month it becomes

11
00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:52.190
twenty, twenty-five minutes, because you add the new contacts plus the ones you started on the previous days.

12
00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.500
But at 8 RelAI tells you: «Look,

13
00:00:54.550 --> 00:01:00.000
you need to contact the people you talked to three days ago, fifteen days ago».

14
00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:05.950
And then it reminds you to add people. As you can see, here are some examples: Laura, Paolo and Sara.

15
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.110
Let's see it in practice. What do you do?

16
00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:15.410
You add a person: you give it the name, the number

17
00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:17.300
and the context.

18
00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:23.200
This is essential, because if you give it the context…

19
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:28.700
Let's take a simple example:

20
00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:31.500
«In May Laura's son left for university.»

21
00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.490
RelAI creates the message with the context you give it.

22
00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:40.780
It's an example: if you also tell it the city, even better. You tell it when you met her,

23
00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.820
everything you remember about her.

24
00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:47.900
And it won't create the wrong message for you, «let me offer you an opportunity».

25
00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:52.700
It builds the relationship with Laura, and then it will understand when

26
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:58.680
to bring her to the goal you already set before starting.

27
00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:04.450
Then you paste the reply she gave to the message you sent.

28
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:10.080
RelAI reads the reply and writes you another message, and so on,

29
00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:16.270
until a history builds up. RelAI will keep helping you build the relationship

30
00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:20.010
with these people, until you bring them to the goal

31
00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:25.370
you set at the start. In the evening, in the evening count, it tells you all the work you did

32
00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:31.090
and gives you the goal for the next day.
